# Fase 4's shadow log. It is written by the edge at run time — including by a
# `cargo run` on the host, which is how the local proof is run — and it sits
# inside a directory both edge images `COPY` wholesale. Without this line, one
# comparison run rewrites the file and invalidates every layer downstream of that
# `COPY`, which on this tree is most of the build. The file is evidence, not
# input; nothing in the image reads it.
edge/shadow.jsonl
